  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "From an incomplete wisdom path inheritance bought with an astral wind flying heavenly boar corpse, Fang Yuan gains mortal Gu recipes for malicious thought Gu and malicious will Gu, plus this wisdom path killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        735
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "gu_malicious_thought_gu",
        "gu_malicious_will_gu",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Back in Hu Immortal blessed land he studies it: the move is not for attacking. Wisdom path methods fill the heart with wisdom path dao marks and turn it into a malicious heart. Success lets blood essence automatically make large numbers of malicious wills and cuts how many malicious wills thinking consumes. It suits a living wisdom path Gu Immortal. As a strength path immortal zombie his heart already holds strength path dao marks, his body is dead, and he cannot nourish malicious will with blood essence or transform the heart, so he cannot use the move. Its inner workings still resemble Fairy Li Shan’s poison breath, where each breath can emit accumulating poison; here each heartbeat would turn blood essence into malicious will.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "research",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "path_wisdom",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fairy_li_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With the light of wisdom he fuses poison breath and harboring malicious heart into a new incomplete immortal move he names poison spit, using Woman’s Heart as the core. Each cast leaves poison in the body, so the move is incomplete; with his immortal zombie body he can use it about three times before leftover poison can kill even his soul.",
      "chapters": [
        745
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "incomplete-immortal-fusion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_womans_heart"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Poison spit later shows traces of this wisdom path killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        748
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "incomplete-immortal-fusion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He keeps the modified immortal move secret until first use, still with woman’s heart Immortal Gu as the core.",
      "chapters": [
        867
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "incomplete-immortal-fusion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Poison breath was modified from this move with Woman’s Heart as the core; it has many flaws and comparatively low value.",
      "chapters": [
        1096
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
